                "text": "The horrible treatment that Jewish students are experiencing on campuses across our country right now is absolutely wrong. These antisemitic protests aimed at intimidating and driving out Jewish students cannot find a haven on any college campus or anywhere in our country. The perpetrators of hatred and the leaders who enable them must be held accountable. We need to make sure that students of every religion feel safe at school. https://t.co/XfLOghyB2o",
