                "text": ".@BreakthroughT1D is the leading global type 1 diabetes research and advocacy research.\n\nAs a member of the Diabetes Caucus, I will continue to support legislation that would improve diabetes research, education and treatment. I appreciate representatives from Breakthrough T1D for stopping by my DC office to discuss how we can work together on these issues.",
