                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I sat down earlier today with Jannie Oosthuizen, President of @Merck Human Health U.S., to discuss the innovative work Merck is doing to advance disease prevention and treatment. \n\nBased in Rahway, Merck is a premier research-driven biopharmaceutical company, committed to developing cutting-edge health solutions for both people and animals. Thank you to Merck for taking the time to meet with me!",
