                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Earlier today, I met with Dr. Seth Lederman, CEO of Tonix Pharmaceuticals, which recently relocated its headquarters to Berkeley Heights. \n\nWe discussed the company\u2019s move to our district, the FDA\u2019s August approval of Tonmya, the first new treatment for fibromyalgia in more than 15 years, and their work developing non-opioid pain treatments for migraines.",
