                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today, I visited the Center for Great Expectations (CGE), a transformative treatment center in Somerset. \n\nCGE is committed to breaking the cycle of abuse, homelessness, and substance use by providing comprehensive, dignified care for men, women, and children. \n\nI am grateful for the opportunity to learn more about their work and the profound impact they are making in our community. Thank you for having me!",
